    "method": "Original generated conceptual illustrations, exported to 320 by 400 WebP. Not application screenshots, scientific results, landscapes for the hero, or personal photographs.",
    "prompts": {
      "oncosyn": "Portrait 4:5 teal/cyan cellular network, dense etched hatching on midnight blue; abstract concept, no diagnostic claim, text, people or UI.",
      "cryptalis": "Portrait near-black mountain with amber/rust illuminated ridges and warm amber sky, engraved ink; no text, people, logo or security claim.",
      "smolink": "Portrait black/ivory winding river through layered mountains, etched contours and stippling, cream paper; no text, people or UI.",
      "unispace": "Original imaginary university arcade and study courtyard. Wide engraved navy/steel-blue and ivory architecture, repeating arches and tall windows, small amber light accent. No people, text, logos, UI, real campus claim or personal-photography claim."
    },
    "originals": "docs/design/project-art-source/",
    "responsiveExport": "The original PNG artwork is also encoded without resizing as 1122 by 1402 WebP. Responsive project-card sources keep the original 320 by 400 export for smaller displays and choose the larger file when needed."
  },
